    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Snapshot Spirit Live!</i> you play as a jetpack-flying photographer named Katie as she hunts ghosts in this educational photography game with minimalist 1-bit-inspired graphics and a Game Boy-inspired soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/a6c6ad653da67afe2ad418d3fa3b2353.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Katie as she flies around a haunted forest to find and photograph a wide variety of cute ghosts and build her photo portfolio. Katie streams her photography and jetpack-flying adventures to viewers, and she comments on what happens each day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/706a9031734ae4d0179833d6cf3143b8.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she gets better at photography, more and more camera features unlock, allowing players to learn about basic photography principles such as the exposure triangle, ISO, aperture, shutter speed, and focus.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/bf9fc569f0facaeaccabbd885a667995.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Snapshot Spirit Live!</i> you play as a jetpack-flying photographer named Katie as she hunts ghosts in this educational photography game with minimalist 1-bit-inspired graphics and a Game Boy-inspired soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/a6c6ad653da67afe2ad418d3fa3b2353.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Katie as she flies around a haunted forest to find and photograph a wide variety of cute ghosts and build her photo portfolio. Katie streams her photography and jetpack-flying adventures to viewers, and she comments on what happens each day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/706a9031734ae4d0179833d6cf3143b8.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she gets better at photography, more and more camera features unlock, allowing players to learn about basic photography principles such as the exposure triangle, ISO, aperture, shutter speed, and focus.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351100/extras/bf9fc569f0facaeaccabbd885a667995.avif?t=1751381533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
